    "body": "STOPPED before claim. Required dependencies #2587 and #2588 remain open and are absent from upstream/main 475373093cde8974c467a6855693cbdadf4827a4.\n\nThe existing crates/sim/src/bin/camcraft-sim.rs accepts a CL file and seven numbers. It rejects --job as an unknown option. The tree has no SimJob or export_sim_job implementation. The simulator window is not implemented.\n\nThe requested post-to-sim launch needs the job exporter and the NC simulator window. Implementing those prerequisites would exceed #2589. No claim, worktree, code change, pinning test, or gate run was made.\n",
